<Layout title={"Privacy Policy | Game Nock"} description={"How Game Nock handles information submitted through this website, including enquiries and cookies."} active="privacy-policy" contact={false}>
<section class="pg-hero"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="glass prose" style="max-width:860px"><p><em>Last updated: 25 September 2026.</em></p>
<p>This policy explains what information Game Nock collects through this website and how it is used.</p>
<h2>Information you give us</h2><p>When you send an enquiry we receive the details you provide, such as your name, work email, company, project information and any documents you attach. We use this information only to respond to your enquiry and discuss a potential project.</p>
<h2>How we store and share it</h2><p>Enquiries are kept in our business email and project tools. We do not sell your information. We share it only with team members involved in responding to you, or where required by law.</p>
<h2>How long we keep it</h2><p>We keep enquiry information for as long as needed to respond and, if we work together, for the duration of the business relationship and any legal retention period.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete your information at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:contact@gamenock.com">contact@gamenock.com</a>.</p>
<h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2><p>This website does not use advertising or analytics cookies. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which may receive your IP address when the page loads. If we add analytics in future, this policy will be updated and consent requested where required.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:contact@gamenock.com">contact@gamenock.com</a>.</p></div></div></section>
</Layout>
